      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, the review clerk should start by reviewing the received application."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause explicitly starts the process (init) and defines the first action step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, they should load the case data."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase preserving exact action content."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the case data is loaded, they should proceed to review the case."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match to the sequential action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "At this point, they need to check if there are any new findings."
      ],
      "justification": "Conditional check inherently models an exclusive split (XOR branch)."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the answer is yes, they should recalculate the refund."
      ],
      "justification": "Boolean guard captures the positive condition; action matches the instructed step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the answer is no, they should send a letter of denial."
      ],
      "justification": "Boolean guard captures the negative condition; action matches the instructed step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n9",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there are, they should recalculate the refund."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard and action faithfully restates the repeat condition and calculation step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, they should send another letter of denial."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard and action faithfully restates the repeat negation condition and denial step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, they should write back the case data and the process will come to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Parallel/repeated paths rejoin (converge), final action executes, and explicit termination statement maps to end node."
    }
